# Formatting

- `title` should be concise and match the business objective from the Phase 1 prompt.
- `columns[].key` must be stable camelCase (or snake_case) identifiers suitable for UI table binding.
- `columns[].label` must be human-readable.
- `availableFilters` should list only filters that are useful for this report and schema-backed.
- When UI filters/page/sort are provided, incorporate them into `filters` / `orderBy` when schema-backed.
- `summary` may include simple totals keys (for example `totalCount` expectation) but must not invent metrics unsupported by the definition.
- Keep `warnings` short and actionable.
